": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Arrangez les phrases myst\u00e8res. D\u00e9placez chaque mot pour le mettre \u00e0 la bonne place. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Vous avez deux essais pour soumettre vos r\u00e9ponses.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "", "coverimg": "", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "Baja California is a beautiful peninsula. It lies between the Pacific Ocean and the Sea of Cortez and is one thousand miles long.", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "People can get there by land, sea or air. In Baja they find deserts, mountains and islands. They also find whales, all kinds of tropical fish and other sea life.", "id": 1, "time": "9301"}, {"image": "", "text": "Diving is very popular in Baja. Both new and experienced divers enjoy diving there.", "id": 2, "time": "22101"}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn4le10ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "frn4le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "frn4le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Excusez-moi, allez-vous faire de la planche \u00e0 voile aujourd'hui&nbsp;?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste </span> : Oui... Comment le savez-vous&nbsp;?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Je vous ai entendu, vous et vos amis, en parler au petit d\u00e9jeuner ce matin.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste</span> : Oui, nous avons h\u00e2te d'aller faire de la planche \u00e0 voile en Basse-Californie.</br>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn4le10ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Il ne fait pas tr\u00e8s beau. Regardez tous ces moutons sur l'eau&nbsp;! Et le vent souffle pas mal aujourd'hui. J'esp\u00e8re que le temps sera mieux cet apr\u00e8s-midi.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste</span> : Vous avez raison. Le temps est assez impr\u00e9visible. Nous sommes un peu nerveux&nbsp;!</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ne vous inqui\u00e9tez pas. Faire de la planche \u00e0 voile en Basse-Californie est une chance unique.</br>", "id": 2, "time": "15500"}, {"image": "frn4le10ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste</span> : Hmmm. On verra.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Allez-vous louer l'\u00e9quipement sur le navire ou \u00e0 la plage&nbsp;?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste</span> : \u00c0 la plage. \u00c0 quelle heure le bus arrive-t-il pour prendre les passagers&nbsp;?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Il arrive \u00e0 10 h pile. Je vais me joindre au groupe aujourd'hui.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Touriste</span> : C'est super !</br>", "id": 3, "time": "34550"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Jean au Mexique ", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "O\u00f9 se trouve ?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Taking a Break > Baja", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage d'une information pr\u00e9cise concernant des indications des lieux dans un \u00e9ventail limit\u00e9 de situations sociales. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations co